{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他舍不得从前自在的日子，一想到以后不能再像过去那样生活，心里就有些慌。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舍不得、慌、不甘心\",\n      \"missed\": \"右上角“离开后才发现心里空了”不够醒目；波兰舞曲的外在舞步与内心旧歌的反差、节奏庄严但旋律脆弱的描述，需要读小字才能抓到。提醒自己受过的气、怕忘记离开的原因，以及不甘心连好日子也一起丢掉，这几层因果也需要顺着读才能完整理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他舍不得过去自在的生活，想起受过的气又提醒自己不要心软，但仍不甘心连以前的好日子也一起失去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舍不得、慌、焦灼、压抑、不甘心\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的音乐推上又退下、三连音催促呼吸、最后仍没落稳，需要逐句读才能理解；“拄杖”“我没事”“把衣服理整齐再抬起头”这些动作背后的自我控制和仍然在意，也不是一眼就能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想留住以前自在而美好的日子，却又记得当初离开的原因，在舍不得和不愿再受伤之间挣扎。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、慌张、焦灼、克制、不甘心\",\n      \"missed\": \"与第二张的文字信息相同，音乐变化的细节和身体动作所表达的心理状态仍然需要读小字才能理解；下方音符动画能感受到音乐在变化，但不容易直接对应到人物的具体处境。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条同样醒目的长句连续出现，第一条讲舍不得和慌，第二条讲提醒自己受过的气，第三条讲不甘心丢掉好日子。它们实际上有很清楚的情绪递进，但第一眼需要在几条长句之间来回抓重点，才能把人物的处境和矛盾完整串起来。中间穿插的音乐分析和动作解释又增加了一层阅读负担。问题不在内容互不相关，而在人物主线被多层文字分散了注意力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0382f000-af20-41a3-8e0a-48c6a4d536ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T000607396071Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:07:40.294774+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f23879f09f84332d36be45f36b5abbe03b8a8b3bf482e100a8e02aa96cfe6b80", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T000607396071Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "67fb3e5ab68c801589b25a800bd86ab4fef15540a8b42deb77dc7480318888c3"}}}
